<title>POLAND: Polish TPSA in PLN 350 mln commercial paper plan.</title>
<headline>Polish TPSA in PLN 350 mln commercial paper plan.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish telecommunications monopoly TPSA has picked Bank Handlowy to lead its 350 million zloty commercial paper programme, Handlowy said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>Full details of the programme will be announced at a news conference on Friday, Handlowy said.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
